&lt;h2 id="i-network-environment-planning"&gt;I. Network Environment Planning&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;etcd host IP: 192.168.8.88 hostname: docker-network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Host1 IP: 192.168.8.188 hostname: web01&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Host2 IP: 192.168.8.99 hostname: web02&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 id="ii-etcd-host-configuration"&gt;II. etcd Host Configuration&lt;/h2&gt;
