&lt;li&gt;Download etcd-v3.6.0-linux-amd64.tar.gz package from github.com&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Copy the package to the etcd host /root directory and extract:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
